    "detail": "The US Supreme Court rejected an emergency appeal from Virginia Democrats seeking to reinstate a redrawn congressional district map, leaving the existing boundaries in place ahead of the 2026 midterm elections. The decision maintains the current district lines that Democrats argued diluted minority voting power, and removes a key avenue for last-minute redistricting changes before the midterms.",
